  "body": "### Summary\nCapture what `profilebdd.php?…&pseudo=<pseudo>` answers (redirect chain and final page), anonymously and logged in, so that the MP list can fetch the avatar of a correspondent whose thread was never opened (#714). HFR-PROTOCOL lists this redirect as pending capture; the MP list rows link it (`sujetCase6`, `R04`, `R08-2`).\n\n### States to capture\n1. Logged in, one-to-one MP row's `profilebdd.php` link as the page carries it: every hop (status, `Location`), the final page (expected `/hfr/profil-<id>.htm`, parsed by `UserProfileParser`, captures R56a/R56b).\n2. The same link without cookies.\n3. A pseudo that does not exist (or a deleted account), logged in.\n\n### Rules\n- `host: mac`, anonymized per docs/FIXTURES.md (pseudos, ids, avatar URLs), independent corpus check; at most one request per minute; record the facts in HFR-PROTOCOL §6c under the fix's subsection.\n\n### Wanted by\n- #714 (MP list avatars by default).\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
